ba5bde41e0e4c248f054a453.poster.avif?t=1784694080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/9d15f55dba5bde41e0e4c248f054a453.webm?t=1784694080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/9d15f55dba5bde41e0e4c248f054a453.mp4?t=1784694080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspired by real cities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're making the most advanced socioeconomic simulation in the history of city builders. That's why we model it on research and data from sources like the World Bank, the OECD and the US Bureau of Labor Statistics. The challenges you face exist in (and teach us about) real life. All the simulation's parameters and their sources are published on our website.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/06efe1b6361c063509d5ea8540365ffc.poster.avif?t=1784694080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/06efe1b6361c063509d5ea8540365ffc.webm?t=1784694080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094120/extras/06efe1b6361c063509d5ea8540365ffc.mp4?t=1784694080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every citizen, household and company is simulated one by one. No fake crowds, no statistical approximations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set income, sales and corporate taxes, plus fees and licenses, then live with the economy you create.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or lose elections: your approval rating is the only win condition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newspaper that covers your city and pins the bad news on you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random incidents that test your plans: heatwaves, recessions, droughts and more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is under active development and we have ambitious plans for years to come. There will never be DLC or a Microlandia 2. We'll keep updating and improving the base game. And there will never be in-game purchases either, because we think they're the worst invention since pineapple on pizza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Microlandia and follow us on Steam to hear about every update.</p>",
